==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Weepinbell|65}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Weepinbell}}.
*{{m|Razor Leaf}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Weepinbell}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

